; LcdKeyRow3_AdvanceDelay_StageZero: row 3 of the five key pairs flanking the LCD; bit 7 of the code picks the
;   CP2 side (set) or the CP1 side (clear); ButtonTable_AdvanceDelay_StageZero slot 0x0A.
