;          (0x2084) again unless bit 0 of (0x20B9) is set.  Finally
;          (0x2082) = code (| 0x80 when bit 0 of (0x20B9)) and
;          `or (0x2071),0x01`, which is what makes PanelButton_RunPending
;          route it on the next PanelTask_Step.
