; sub_F94CBB` (0xF95C52: 16 x sub_F94CDE, address + 8 hex bytes, (0x284A) += 8). Zeroes (0x2540), (0x284F).
; Callers: sub_F959C8 (T_ScreenEnter_DebugMonitor screen ENTER) and the six digit editors sub_F95A1A..sub_F95BCA.
