;   0xF95C95-0xF95D14   32 LE32 pointers.  Read by 0xF958B4
;                       `mul XBC,(XIZ+0x08) / add XBC,0x00F95C95 /
;                       ld XBC,(XBC) / ... / jp T,XBC`, bounded by that
;                       routine's own `cp (XIZ+0x08),0x001F / jr UGT` at
