; Evidence: arm 0 of the 4-entry table at 0xFADDF1 -- the LE32 word at 0xFADDF1 reads 0x00FADE01; reader `ld XIX,0x00faddf1` at 0xFADDE5, index (0x7F32) & 3 = PROG CHANGE MODE (DLTable_NormalTechRemap[0] = "NORMAL").
