;          0xFB2070 admits indices 0..5.  ★ LAST-ENTRY TEST: entry 5 is
;          0x00FB20B7 and 0xFB2081 + 6*4 = 0xFB2099, which is entry 0's own
;          target -- the table tiles exactly up to the code it dispatches to.
