; which manipulates the disk state area at 0x605Axx and issues Fdc_Request-
; family operations.  Arguments arrive in BC (XSP+0x0a) and XDE (XSP+0x06).
; Evidence: 0xFE42A0 `lda XIX,0xFE6DFC` + `mx_ld_rm` + `lda XIX,0xFE42B4` +
