;          included, and the byte-per-sector code N is 2 -> 512 and 3 -> 1024.
;          notes/prom_a_fdc_checks.py re-reads all 30 immediates from the ROM.
; Unknown:  nothing here; every immediate is accounted for.
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------
