;          then `djnz16 IZ` runs the body once, and Fdc_DelayTicks HALVES its
;          argument, so `pushw 0x0a` is 5 ticks, about 10 ms on the 488.28 Hz
;          tick.  ⚠ An earlier draft of this line said "two 5-tick delays".
;          XIZ saved and restored.
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------
